WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How are you?
-I'm wonderful.

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we have had just
the most wonderful afternoon.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:05.438
You, Fred, and I sat down,
and we got to catch up and talk.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:09.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my second year at "SNL"
was your first year.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And we, one day,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.581
made a decision that we were
gonna go -- It was your idea.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You wanted to go to Boston

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
to watch Michael Jordan's
last game.

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:21.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-In Boston.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
As a Washington Wizard.
-Yes.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not his last game
as a Chicago Bull.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.060
You wanted to see his last game
as a Washington Wizard.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I never got to a chance
to see him as a Bull,

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:31.898 line:92%
so I thought this would be

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
my only chance
to see him play basketball.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.670
-We had to get on a super-early
train to go to Boston.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Because it was a day game.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was after "SNL."
-Yes.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But that's really not
the crazy part.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.577 line:92%
The crazy part is what you wore.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.579 line:92%
Because this was a sketch,

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
the last sketch of the night
at "SNL" with Bernie Mac.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:50.717 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:55.055
-And this, I think, was Bernie
Mac's House of Comedy Suits?

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.323 line:92%
-Yes, and I believe it was you

00:00:57.323 --> 00:01:00.193
who talked me into wearing that
to the after party.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:01.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-So I was like,

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.230 line:92%
"Ah, okay, yeah, I'll do it."

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.765 line:92%
And wait. Did you not dress up?

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:09.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I didn't.
-Oh. Okay. I did-- Okay.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.371 size:75% position:38%
So, yes, I wore that
to the after party,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:14.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then a couple drinks in,
I think you suggested,

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:17.243
"You should just go ahead
and wear that to the game.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just wear it all the way up
in the train up there

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.114 line:92%
and then wear it to the game."

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:24.751
And I was like,
"That sounds like a great idea."

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.720 line:92%
-And so I go on this train ride,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a couple hours
into the train ride,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.691 line:92%
sobering up a little bit.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "What have I done?
What have I done?"

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm walking around --
"Oh, my God."

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I should --
The best thing about this

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
was it was your first year
on the show.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.869 line:92%
You were definitely not famous.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:43.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, for sure.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:47.774
-You were just
a super-weird guy in this suit.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.876
Even though you had been
on "SNL" in that very suit

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
last night, nobody was making
the connection.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.346 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I pull it off, though.

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Also, I don't know
if you remember that --

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:58.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
My parents met us at the game.
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is when you met
my parents.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.254 line:92%
That was what you were wearing

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first time
you met my parents.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.258 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-And they still like me?

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:06.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I will say,
that is not even close

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
to one of the craziest things
you've done.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:13.833
And you also have friends
who are very much in line,

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:17.036 line:92%
I feel, with your fun of pranks,

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.438 size:88% position:44% line:92%
enjoying taking chances.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:19.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I've got some
weirdo friends.

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.541 size:81% position:41%
-And you have a friend
who gives a prank gift

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:23.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
to all of his friends
every year.

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.310 line:92%
-Yes. There's this one guy.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:29.516
He, for reasons you will see
soon, will remain nameless.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:34.387 size:88% position:44%
But one year, he gave us
a calendar of his poos.

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:35.355 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which is gross.
And I still have it.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:45.632
One year, he gave us a black mug
that when you heat it up,

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:50.537 size:88% position:44%
images of his testicles
appear all over the mug.

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:51.104 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Got it.

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:53.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then this year
for Christmas,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.407 line:92%
we're all sitting around.

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:56.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
John Solomon also received
one of these pillows.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:03:01.314
This is what we got.
We get this, you know, simple --

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, geez.

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.516
You can kind of see it already,
but there is --

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:05.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, there we go.
So, this is what we got.

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.487 line:92%
Just, like, a simple pillow

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:11.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
with metal -- silver sequins
as you can see.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, this is one
of those things where

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:15.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you rub it the other way,
an image comes out.

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:18.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me show you
what's the image.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:22.268 line:92%
-[ Laughs ] Go over there.

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:23.903 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience gasps ]

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:29.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, let me --
That's the right side up.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:33.279 line:92%
-Now, obviously, put it down

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we're gonna
have to blur it.

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:37.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
And basically, people at home,
the only way

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:40.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
they're going to have to judge
what it was

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:42.322
is by the noise that they made,
the audience here made.

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:47.460
-It is a super close-up picture
of this guys ball sac.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And to give you an idea of --

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:53.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so close-up that
just picture Seth's face

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:56.402 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
as a nut sac.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:01.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is like you're
looking at his nuts.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:01.975 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like that.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:04.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's that close.
-Yeah.

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:06.012 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:06.012 --> 00:04:07.547 line:92%
-So, what did you do with it?

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:10.917
-Oh, so, I received this thing,
and I'm like,

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:15.154
"This is great," but then I had
a really interesting idea.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.590 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I re-gifted it.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:22.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
I brought it up to my mom.
Hello, Mom.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Patty. Patty Forte.
-Patty Forte.

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:27.600
And I gave it to her with the
silver-sequins side up there,

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.270
and I'm like, "Mom, I thought --
Somebody gave me this pillow,

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:33.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it doesn't match
the color scheme of my house,

00:04:33.039 --> 00:04:35.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I thought
it would fit in here."

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:37.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she was like,
"Oh, I love it!"

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I don't think
she really --

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:41.080 size:78% position:39%
-Well, she looks like
she likes it there.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a shot of her.
-Yeah.

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:47.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, did you maybe goad her
into taking this photo?

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:52.925
-No. She does --
She is the best mom of all time.

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.294 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So she loves anything,

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.763 size:88% position:44%
even this like, kind of,
normal sequined pillow.

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:59.132 line:92%
So she found a place for it.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I will say,
it fits right in there.

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It fits right in.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:04.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, now, has she not --
She's never found --

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.705 size:81% position:41%
-It's been two months,
and my thing was like,

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:09.509
"I'm just going to see how long
it takes her to figure out --

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:12.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
to brush the thing
the other way."

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:16.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's been two months,
and she --

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:19.585 line:92%
This is the reveal to Mom.

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:20.920 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
Merry Christmas, Mom.
I love you.

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:26.059 size:75% position:38%
-We love you, Patty.
We love you, Patty.

